   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Short instructions",
     "texto": [
      "In a direct instruction the imperative is used: **Les teksten** («read the text»), **Skriv svaret** («write the answer»). For many verbs the **-e** of the infinitive is dropped: **å fylle → fyll**.",
      "After **skal**, **kan** and **må**, the infinitive is used: **Du må fylle ut skjemaet** («you have to fill in the form»). The imperative is direct; you can soften it with **kan du …?**"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Forms",
     "texto": [
      "**Fylle ut et skjema** means «to fill in a form». **Sett kryss** means «put a cross». The Norwegian noun often has the definite form attached at the end: **skjema → skjemaet**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
